TEST-NAS-MIB DEFINITIONS ::= BEGIN
IMPORTS enterprises, OBJECT-TYPE FROM SNMPv2-SMI;
testNas OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { enterprises 99999 }
systemStatus OBJECT-TYPE
  SYNTAX INTEGER { normal(1), failed(2) }
  MAX-ACCESS read-only
  STATUS current
  DESCRIPTION "Whether the system is well."
  ::= { testNas 1 }
END

server_names.description:
Names its certificate carries for agents, from its enrollment
token (ADR-0025) or confirmed by an administrator (ADR-0066);
renewal keeps them.

function.description:
`window`: `avg`, `min`, `max`, `change` or `rate` (per second);
`compare`: `ratio` (now divided by then) or `difference` (now minus
then). Absent for other kinds.
